Exercise the tracefs interface for trace remote with a set of tests to
check:

  * loading/unloading (unloading.tc)
  * reset (reset.tc)
  * size changes (buffer_size.tc)
  * consuming read (trace_pipe.tc)
  * non-consuming read (trace.tc)

